    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n// Main GPMI Review workflow \u2014 Code Node: \"Merge Binaries\"\n// Mode: Run Once for All Items\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------\n// Position:  HTTP Request (download) \u2192 [THIS NODE] \u2192 Primary Is PDF? \u2192 Extract & Prepare / Handle Primary PDF\n//\n// Collects the N separately-downloaded items (each holding one file under\n// binary.data, per the HTTP Request node's \"Put Output File in Field\")\n// back into ONE item whose binary object has keys \"primary_document\" /\n// \"reference_documents_0\" / \"reference_documents_1\" / ... \u2014 exactly the\n// shape Extract & Prepare already expects (it does\n// allKeys.filter(k => k.startsWith('primary_document')) /\n// .filter(k => k.startsWith('reference_documents'))), so Extract & Prepare\n// itself needs NO changes.\n//\n// Also renames each file to the {gpdl_reference}-{document_name}-\n// {product_code}{ext} convention, deriving the extension from the\n// downloaded mimeType.\n//\n// NOTE: n8n's HTTP Request node REPLACES each item's json with the response\n// metadata \u2014 it does NOT pass through the fields set in \"Prepare Download\n// List\" (binary_key, document_name, gpdl_reference, pipeline_key, etc.).\n// HTTP Request processes items 1:1 in order, so we re-pair each downloaded\n// item with its original metadata by INDEX via $('Prepare Download List').\n//\n// IMPORTANT: pipeline_key / gpmi_record_id / primary_gpdl_record_id are\n// preserved in THIS node's own json output. Extract & Prepare's output does\n// NOT carry these fields forward \u2014 so any LATER node in this same execution\n// (e.g. the future \"update Zoho Creator with report URL\" step) must\n// reference them via:\n//   {{ $('Merge Binaries').first().json.primary_gpdl_record_id }}\n//   {{ $('Merge Binaries').first().json.pipeline_key }}\n// This works because each GATE call triggers a separate execution of this\n// workflow, and this node runs exactly once per execution.\n//\n// primaryIsPdf: true when the primary_document itself is a PDF. The\n// downstream \"Primary Is PDF?\" IF node reads this flag to send PDF\n// primaries to \"Handle Primary PDF\" instead of \"Extract & Prepare\" (which\n// only knows how to unzip/parse DOCX locally).\n// \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n\nconst downloadedItems = $input.all();\nconst originalItems = $('Prepare Download List').all();\n\nconst binary = {};\nlet passthrough = {};\nlet primaryIsPdf = false;\n\nfor (let i = 0; i < downloadedItems.length; i++) {\n  const meta = originalItems[i].json;\n  const srcBinary = downloadedItems[i].binary?.data;\n  if (!srcBinary) continue;\n\n  const key = meta.binary_key;\n  const contentType = (srcBinary.mimeType || '').toLowerCase();\n  let ext = '.bin';\n  if (contentType.includes('pdf')) ext = '.pdf';\n  else if (contentType.includes('wordprocessingml') || contentType.includes('msword')) ext = '.docx';\n\n  binary[key] = {\n    ...srcBinary,\n    fileName: `${meta.gpdl_reference}-${meta.document_name}-${meta.product_code}${ext}`,\n  };\n\n  if (key === 'primary_document') {\n    primaryIsPdf = ext === '.pdf';\n    passthrough = {\n      pipeline_key: meta.pipeline_key,\n      batch_id: meta.batch_id,\n      gpmi_record_id: meta.gpmi_record_id,\n      primary_gpdl_record_id: meta.primary_gpdl_record_id,\n      primaryIsPdf,\n    };\n  }\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: passthrough, binary }];\n"
      },
