        "content": "PHASE 5 \u2014 PDF GENERATION\n(All 31 branches converge at Prepare PDF)\n\nPrepare PDF:\n  Convergence point \u2014 every doc type meets here\n  Carries formatted_report (HTML) + pdf_filename\n\nWake Up Render \u2192 same cold-start loop\n  (server must be awake before HTML\u2192PDF call)\n\nGenerate PDF1:\n  POST HTML \u2192 custom Render /html-to-pdf API\n  Returns binary PDF file\n\nRename PDF1:\n  Sets filename = GPMI_[Product]_[Date].pdf",
