    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPHASE 4B \u2014 GENERIC AI REVIEW LOOP\n\nLoop Over Items (generic):\n  Standard n8n batch loop \u2014 runs once per split chunk\n  (or once total, for non-splitting types \u2014 same node either way)\n\nAI Review Agent (generic) + OpenAI Chat Model (generic):\n  ONE agent node serves every document type.\n  Its system prompt isn't hardcoded \u2014 it's read fresh each loop\n  iteration from {{ $json.systemMessage }}, which arrived via Merge\n  Config/Split and is carried on every batch item. Swap the Data Table\n  row \u2192 swap the entire audit prompt, no node changes required.\n\nRecombine After Agent:\n  Same n8n quirk as Merge Config: the Agent node's own output only\n  carries {output: \"...\"} \u2014 it drops everything else. This node\n  re-attaches the original item (docType, all the *Code fields) so the\n  next loop iteration \u2014 and the steps after the loop \u2014 still have them.\n\nWait (generic):\n  Simple rate-limit pause between AI calls, feeding back into the loop.",
